{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏眼前的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"搅坏眼前的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思转去替对方高兴，提醒自己，真心盼对方好这件事本身就让他开心。\",\n      \"key\": \"替对方高兴\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"想确认自己是否特别的紧张暂时退了，他不再计较给了多少，也不怕显得更在乎，觉得自己还有许多心意可给。\",\n      \"key\": \"心意可给\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他放开些去喜欢，反倒更舍不得这一刻过去，又怕给对方压力，热情便收了回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得这一刻\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是把这阵轻松当成保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R15\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他要保护眼前快乐、不愿把喜欢变成催促的意思。S02-3说明这份快乐从何而来，S03-5补出新紧张的直接前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把普遍劝诫落到他真心替对方高兴这件事本身。不再重复S02-2已说过的不索取回应，而由S04-1承接此刻重新转向的原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R17\", \"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-3\", \"S04-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并拆分\",\n      \"why\": \"S04-3明确写出想确认自己是否特别的紧张暂时退去，保留不计较给出多少、不怕显得更在乎，并把抽象的丰盈感改成他觉得自己还有心意可给。S04-4单独写出舍不得这一刻过去、又怕给对方压力的拉扯，解释热情为何一度放开又收回。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时有效的调整误当成不会失去的保证，作为S05中欢喜平息后仍想被看见、继而难堪的直接前提。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R16\", \"R17\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S04-2\", \"S04-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"调整跨段箭头\",\n      \"why\": \"删去上轮S02-2→S04-2和S02-5→S04-3。前者不能单独解释新紧张出现后的转向，后者只写出旧状态，不能解释确认焦虑为何退去；当前因果由本段前后条目承接。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6546020b-8fe4-4a34-8b48-8480b5ad6d06", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T152116689116Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1111.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:39:48.219619+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7645d4373a42e4f6030acb21db19a2b46bd374f4f135f3ef14f80f7ee6e26c19", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\music